  "question": {
    "text": "Place the following alcohols in decreasing order of rate of dehydration with concentrated H<sub>2</sub>SO<sub>4</sub> :<br />\r<br />\r1. CH<sub>3</sub>CH<sub>2</sub>CH(OH)CH<sub>2</sub>CH<sub>2</sub>CH<sub>3</sub><br />\r<br />\r2. (CH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>2</sub>C(OH)CH<sub>2</sub>CH<sub>2</sub>CH<sub>3</sub><br />\r<br />\r3. (CH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>2</sub>C(OH)CH(CH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>2</sub><br />\r<br />\r4. CH<sub>3</sub>CH<sub>2</sub>CH(OH)CH(CH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>2</sub><br />\r<br />\r​5. CH<sub>3</sub>CH<sub>2</sub>CH<sub>2</sub>CH<sub>2</sub>CH<sub>2</sub>CH<sub>2</sub>OH",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
